flowchart LR
    HR[HR system / source data] --> IAM[IAM validation and approval]
    IAM --> DIR[Directory / identity provider]
    IAM --> APP[Business applications]
    USER[Employee or contractor] --> IDP[Authentication]
    IDP --> APP
    APP --> AUTHZ[Authorization check: role and entitlement]
    AUTHZ --> LOG[Audit and access evidence]
